H('c.2.C',3,"If a source work is under copyright, an artist can ethically appropriate its imagery by doing what?",
  "Transforming it substantially, giving credit and following legal limits",["Copying it exactly","Selling it unchanged","Hiding the source"],"Responsible appropriation transforms and credits.")
H('c.2.D',3,"A student layers fragments of old letters in a mixed-media piece to express the passage of time. This is an example of what?",
  "Communicating ideas through original artwork",["Reproducing a poster","Tracing a template","Following a recipe"],"Original work expresses ideas.")
H('c.2.D',3,"Which feature most strongly makes an artwork communicate an impression of calm?",
  "Soft colors, open space and gentle horizontal lines",["Jagged red lines","Crowded dark shapes","Sharp diagonals"],"Quiet elements suggest calm.")
